---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import { ArrowRight, GitBranch, Database, Shield } from 'lucide-react';

const title = 'Lineage Graphs & State — MoroAI Architecture';
const description = 'How MoroAI tracks data and model provenance through a Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) state manager.';
---

<DocsLayout title={title} description={description} currentSlug="/docs/concepts/lineage-graphs/">
  <div class="not-prose mb-8">
    <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-moro-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-moro-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-moro-500/20 mb-3 inline-block">
      Subsystem 02
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">Lineage Graphs & Provenance</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 text-base mt-2">
      Immutable, cryptographically verifiable lifecycle tracking across raw datasets, recipes, checkpoints, and deployments.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) State Engine</h2>
  <p>
    MoroAI maintains an embedded ACID-compliant SQLite graph database located at <code>.moro/state.db</code>. Every artifact in the platform is represented as a node connected by directional provenance edges:
  </p>

  <pre class="bg-dark-950 p-4 rounded-xl border border-dark-800 font-mono text-xs text-sky-300">
Raw Dataset (.jsonl)
    ↓ [DERIVED_FROM]
Compiled Dataset Version
    ↓ [TRAINED_ON]
Training Run Checkpoint
    ↓ [EVALUATED_BY]
Evaluation Gate Result
    ↓ [RELEASED_FROM]
Release Candidate (SBOM)
    ↓ [DEPLOYED_TO]
Local Ollama / vLLM Instance
    ↓ [FEEDBACK_MINED]
DPO Preference Pairs
  </pre>

  <h2>Auditing Provenance</h2>
  <p>
    From any deployed model, operators can trace the complete provenance chain back to the exact input data lines and cryptographic hashes:
  </p>

  <pre class="bg-dark-950 p-4 rounded-xl border border-dark-800 font-mono text-xs text-emerald-400">
# Inspect complete lineage of a deployment:
moro release verify --release-id rel_v1_prod
  </pre>

  <div class="not-prose mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-dark-800 flex items-center justify-between">
    <a href="/docs/concepts/ppci-filtering/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">
      ← PPMI Filtering
    </a>
    <a href="/docs/concepts/recipe-engine/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-moro-500 hover:bg-moro-400 text-white font-semibold text-xs transition-colors">
      <span>Hardware Recipe Engine</span>
      <ArrowRight class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
    </a>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
